president of the parents' association.

326
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:05,160
That's quite a famous last name.

327
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:09,640
I dug a little deeper. It's confirmed.

328
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:12,000
She started this.

329
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:15,040
<i>She's the one who's been bullying Junjai</i>
<i>all this time.</i>

330
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:16,440
<i>But she kept getting away with it,</i>

331
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:18,240
<i>and the whole class</i>
<i>started turning a blind eye.</i>

332
00:22:18,320 --> 00:22:19,720
<i>I'm sorry, Junjai.</i>

333
00:22:19,800 --> 00:22:21,560
<i>Then they started going along with it.</i>

334
00:22:22,080 --> 00:22:24,920
I don't get it.
Why the hell is she doing it?

335
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:28,160
Maybe she doesn't like her.
Maybe it's just for fun.

336
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:31,400
Or worse, maybe she wants to boost
her own status.

337
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:35,960
Some people put others down
to feel superior.

338
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:38,200
It wouldn't surprise me
if she was one of them.

339
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:40,120
In this day and age?

340
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:44,320
And at our school, too.

341
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:46,680
Come on. We keep to ourselves too.

342
00:22:48,520 --> 00:22:50,400
True. That's such an echo chamber.

343
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,040
I'm not okay with this.

344
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:59,400
Those little shits need a lesson, huh?

345
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:02,360
Guys, let's fight back.

346
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:04,800
Hold on.

347
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:07,240
How are people like us
supposed to do that?

348
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:10,640
Yeah. We can barely make a move as it is.

349
00:23:13,280 --> 00:23:18,320
Then we don't have to make a move.

350
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:21,720
Gale, I need more information.

351
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:23,360
Everything you can get.

352
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,720
I've got an idea.

353
00:23:58,840 --> 00:24:01,640
You might as well admit
what trouble you caused.

354
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:03,320
Look at this!

355
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,720
Bullying?

356
00:24:08,560 --> 00:24:12,200
Ma'am, we were just playing around.

357
00:24:12,280 --> 00:24:16,080
There isn't even any direct evidence.

358
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:21,400
You're making accusations, you know.

359
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:26,280
We don't have any more evidence
of the bullying.

360
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:28,640
But this time, we have this.

361
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:35,080
These secret accounts are yours,
aren't they, Ploypim?

362
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:38,520
Shit. How did she find out?

363
00:24:40,120 --> 00:24:41,480
Where did you get these, ma'am?

364
00:24:41,560 --> 00:24:43,240
I don't have to answer that.

365
00:24:47,080 --> 00:24:49,600
<i>But I've checked all this information.</i>

366
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,320
<i>It's reliable.</i>

367
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:55,000
The point is,
you posted everything on here.

368
00:24:55,600 --> 00:24:58,040
The bullying, our school's name,

369
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:00,280
<i>and even cheating on exams.</i>

370
00:25:05,080 --> 00:25:07,600
"This school only hires stupid teachers."

371
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:10,680
"Cheating on exams is freaking easy."

372
00:25:11,480 --> 00:25:12,880
"I'm not scared of the principal."

373
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:15,000
"She's just my dad's lapdog."

374
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:19,960
How dare you
disgrace our school like this?

375
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:23,400
I never imagined that a supposedly
well-behaved student like you

376
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:24,920
could behave in such a disgraceful manner.

377
00:25:28,840 --> 00:25:32,040
Seriously, Gale,
you're starting to scare me.

378
00:25:32,120 --> 00:25:34,160
You're way too good at this.

379
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:38,880
Well, do you think Ploypim
will figure out it was us?

380
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:40,000
Let her.

381
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:43,400
That's even better.
Then she'll focus on us instead.

382
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:46,160
Are you serious?

383
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:49,600
Guys, we're good at covering our tracks.

384
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:52,360
No one at this school can touch us.

385
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:57,760
And most importantly, we helped someone.

386
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:01,200
That's a good thing.

387
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:08,960
- What?
- Get up.

388
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:09,880
Up, up, up.

389
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:11,280
- Come here.
- What's with you?

390
00:26:11,360 --> 00:26:13,440
What the hell is wrong with you guys?
Have you gone crazy?

391
00:26:13,520 --> 00:26:16,680
You've been acting really weird lately.

392
00:26:16,760 --> 00:26:20,240
Why are you so fixated on Junjai?

393
00:26:20,320 --> 00:26:21,680
What's weird about it?

394
00:26:21,760 --> 00:26:25,880
She's being bullied. Of course I'd help.

395
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:27,200
That's perfectly normal.

396
00:26:27,280 --> 00:26:30,360
It is, for anyone who isn't us.

397
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:32,760
You know better than anyone

398
00:26:33,320 --> 00:26:36,960
why we've kept such a low profile
all this time.

399
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:45,200
We're not trying to stop you.
We're ready to help.

400
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:47,000
We just want to understand

401
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:50,920
why you'd risk so much for her.

402
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:54,680
Let me get straight to the point.

403
00:26:55,880 --> 00:27:01,040
Junjai is the girl you've been seeing
in your dreams, isn't she?

404
00:27:10,080 --> 00:27:11,040
Yes.

405
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:13,800
Holy shit.

406
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:19,240
You don't have to believe me.

407
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:24,640
I can barely believe it myself.

408
00:27:25,840 --> 00:27:26,800
She's…

409
00:27:27,800 --> 00:27:33,640
Actually, she's nothing like
the girl in my dreams.

410
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,000
But…

411
00:27:38,840 --> 00:27:40,920
the moment I looked into her eyes…

412
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:46,520
<i>I just knew</i>

413
00:27:47,280 --> 00:27:49,080
<i>they were the same person.</i>

414
00:27:49,800 --> 00:27:51,240
<i>Then my mind</i>

415
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:55,240
went completely blank.

416
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:02,080
I don't understand.

417
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:04,040
What happened to her?

418
00:28:04,680 --> 00:28:09,600
How did that girl with such a bright smile
end up like this?

419
00:28:10,240 --> 00:28:13,040
And why does my heart race so much?

420
00:28:13,800 --> 00:28:18,680
Everything in my head is a mess.
Everything has fucking changed.

421
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,640
Since I met her…

422
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:54,120
I haven't been able
to stop thinking about her.

423
00:28:56,760 --> 00:28:58,160
I'm sorry, guys.

424
00:29:01,280 --> 00:29:03,000
That wasn't so hard, now was it?

425
00:29:04,320 --> 00:29:05,840
Oh, come on!

426
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:07,960
Why did you wait until now to tell us?

427
00:29:08,040 --> 00:29:09,440
See? I told you!

428
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:13,360
You… you all believe me?

429
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,560
Of course.

430
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:19,040
How long have we been friends, huh?

431
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:21,840
Exactly.

432
00:29:22,840 --> 00:29:24,400
Thanks, guys.

433
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:25,640
Hey.

434
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:27,680
But if that's the case,

435
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:30,520
what we've done for her
might not be enough.

436
00:29:31,520 --> 00:29:32,680
Why?

437
00:29:34,560 --> 00:29:37,720
We've helped her within the school rules.

438
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:40,360
But with someone like Ploypim,

439
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:43,840
playing by the rules might not be enough.

440
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:53,560
JUNJAI THE GECKO

441
00:30:08,520 --> 00:30:12,560
<i>And if that's the case,</i>
<i>things could get even worse.</i>

442
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:16,240
Especially for Junjai.

443
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:24,360
Hey, Aidao!

444
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:26,480
- Hey! Aidao!
- Bitch.

445
00:30:26,560 --> 00:30:27,720
Let go!

446
00:30:27,800 --> 00:30:29,480
- Let go!
- Bitch!

447
00:30:29,560 --> 00:30:31,840
- I wasn't the one who told the teacher.
- I don't care!

448
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:34,080
Hey.

449
00:30:34,840 --> 00:30:35,920
Hey, relax.

450
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:37,760
Aidao.

451
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:42,280
You loved seeing me get busted,
didn't you?! Satisfied, huh?!

452
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:44,320
Hey, have you seen Junjai?

453
00:30:44,400 --> 00:30:46,440
You loved seeing me get yelled at,
didn't you?!

454
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:48,200
Satisfied, huh?!

455
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:52,680
Oh no.

456
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:39,360
Were…

457
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:42,960
you the ones who…?

458
00:31:43,040 --> 00:31:45,040
I… I'm sorry.

459
00:31:47,360 --> 00:31:50,320
We were just trying to help.

460
00:31:51,040 --> 00:31:52,840
We didn't think it through enough.

461
00:31:54,040 --> 00:31:56,000
We didn't think it would…

462
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:59,400
Oh, it's okay.

463
00:31:59,480 --> 00:32:01,280
I'm actually glad.

464
00:32:01,360 --> 00:32:03,440
They deserved to get in trouble for once.

465
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:14,680
Thank you.

466
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:22,920
Wait.

467
00:32:28,360 --> 00:32:31,040
Do you want to put an end
to this for good?

468
00:32:35,120 --> 00:32:38,120
It's not that simple.

469
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:39,600
Just answer me.

470
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:45,880
Do you really want it to stop?

471
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:55,320
Good.

472
00:32:56,640 --> 00:32:58,000
Then we'll help you.

473
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:01,400
Yeah.

474
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:03,640
We're all in now, huh?

475
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:09,160
What are you going to do?

476
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:11,320
If Ploypim likes playing dirty,

477
00:33:12,360 --> 00:33:14,160
we'll just play dirty too.

478
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:18,360
And don't worry.

479
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:23,120
No one plays dirty better than Toxxxxin.

480
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:45,520
Din, time to repay that favor.

481
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:47,400
What?

482
00:34:08,840 --> 00:34:10,639
Hello? Wi, can you hear me?

483
00:34:11,239 --> 00:34:13,000
Yeah, I've left the house.

484
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:14,920
What's gotten into you?

485
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:17,199
Why'd you suddenly drag me out this late?

486
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:20,520
<i>Just… give me a second.</i>

487
00:34:21,239 --> 00:34:24,120
Are you okay? You sound weird.

488
00:34:24,199 --> 00:34:26,280
<i>Well…</i>

489
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:28,639
You'd better not
be pulling some prank on me.

490
00:34:29,560 --> 00:34:30,800
If you are--

491
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:31,880
<i>What the--?!</i>

492
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:33,040
<i>Who are you?!</i>

493
00:34:33,120 --> 00:34:34,440
<i>Let go! Let go of me!</i>

494
00:34:34,520 --> 00:34:35,840
<i>What are you doing?</i>

495
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,159
<i>Let me go!</i>

496
00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:44,639
Hey!

497
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:48,639
What's going on?

498
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:52,600
Who's doing this to me?
Who's doing this?

499
00:34:58,520 --> 00:34:59,880
Wi, is that you?

500
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:00,840
WIPADA

501
00:35:02,040 --> 00:35:03,120
Who's doing this to me?

502
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:05,440
Who the hell are you?
Who's doing this?

503
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:29,200
Nice to meet you, Ploypim.

504
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:38,400
You know who we are, right?

505
